<title>HUNGARY: HUNGARY 1-MO BUBOR RATE 21.50 PCT, 3-MO 21.27 PCT.</title>
<headline>HUNGARY 1-MO BUBOR RATE 21.50 PCT, 3-MO 21.27 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's Budapest Interbank Offered Rates (BUBOR) remained steady at 21.50 percent for the one-month maturity and for the three-month maturity rose to 21.27 percent, up 0.01 on Tuesday's rate, the National Bank of Hungary (NBH) said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327 4040</p>
